# SET_EFFECT (module/effects_sim.c): crates/scene's vectors through lamp_effect.c; HELLO bit 19;
# PLACE, EFFECT and RELEASE replies (D7 8F) and what each half is told; a still effect drawn
# once, a moving one every 33 ms on its clock; it lives through an endpoint change; SET_FRAME
# takes over and an effect takes back quietly; bad requests answer 5. The scene owns the lights:
# it draws through idle and the user's off, RGB_SYNC (D7 81), the PC (D7 83, read by the case)
# and the right hear the real on/off, and RELEASE puts it back.
/^effects:/p
/^hostlink: rx D7 8[1CF]/p
s/.*hid_listener_keycode/kp/p
